<title>MALAYSIA: Berjaya Toto, Berjaya Capital suspended.</title>
<headline>Berjaya Toto, Berjaya Capital suspended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Berjaya Sports Toto Bhd and Berjaya Capital Bhd were suspended on Monday pending an announcement, an official at the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>He said trading in the shares Kuantan Flour Mills Bhd has also been suspended at the company's request.</p>
<p>Shares of gaming firm Berjaya Sports Toto and Berjaya Capital, which is involved in financial services, closed at 10.50 and 2.40 ringgit respectively on Friday.</p>
<p>Kuantan Flour Mills shares were last traded at 8.10 ringgit.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
